<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-TEAMS FOR FRANCE VS BRAZIL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TEAMS FOR FRANCE VS BRAZIL.</headline>
<dateline>LYON, France 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for the opening match of the four-team Tournoi de France between France and Brazil on Tuesday:</p>
<p>France - 16-Fabien Barthez; 2-Vincent Candela, 5-Laurent Blanc, 8-Marcel Desailly, 12-Bixente Lizarazu; 13-Ibrahim Ba, 19-Christian Karembeu, 7-Didier Deschamps, 10-Zinedine Zidane; 22-Florian Maurice, 14-Robert Pires.</p>
<p>Brazil - 1-Taffarel; 2-Cafu, 15-Celio Silva, 3-Aldair, 6-Roberto Carlos; 7-Giovanni, 5-Mauro Silva, 8-Dunga, 10-Leonardo; 9-Ronaldo, 11-Romario.</p>
<p>Referee: Kim Milton Nielsen (Denmark)</p>
